Children",,United Kingdom,"We expect that each of those entities will have suitable anti-slavery and human trafficking policies and processes. We expect each entity in the supply chain to, at the very least, adopt 'one-up' due diligence on the next link in the supply chain. It is not practical for us (and every other participant in the supply chain) to have a direct relationship with all of the links in the supply chain, such as the ultimate producer, manufacturer or service provider.","We work with three main outsourcing companies. These companies have signed the Agency Compliance Agreement and audits have been, and will continue to be, carried out at regular intervals",Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
