Refugees",,United Kingdom,"In the first instance, Leonardo Hotels UK and Ireland ask that all recruitment agencies of permanent employees sign and agree to the Agency Compliance Agreement. Any new agency that Leonardo Hotels UK and Ireland is looking to engage will be requested and expected to sign the Agency Compliance Agreement",,Yes,,,"Our processes, training and measures to prevent modern slavery are robust, however we continue to audit our suppliers. We continue to improve our recruitment activity to reduce agency use.",2026-05-26T08:02:03,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/CxN3Wu76/2026/Modern Slavery and Human Trafficking Statement - 2025 1.pdf
