Children",,India,"This  is a global risk that is not specific to any single country. We have highlighted  our concerns regarding this during our presentations to in-country suppliers. We have reiterated the significant importance we place on transparency and the maintenance of accurate production location details. Our COP teams conduct the majority of audits on an unannounced basis, they are well-positioned to identify instances of unauthorised subcontracting and work with suppliers to remediate.",Forced labour,Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
