Tier 2 suppliers",Other vulnerable groups,"contracted workers in security, cleaning, or catering",India,"We address modern slavery risks through risk‑based due diligence across operations and suppliers, clear human rights standards in contracts, annual reviews of higher‑risk suppliers, AI‑enabled monitoring, training, audits, and speak‑up channels with investigation and remediation.","Low‑skilled onsite services: Risk of exploitation of contracted workers in security, cleaning, or catering services at facilities in certain regions.",Within your supply chains,Tier 2 suppliers,Other vulnerable groups,"contracted workers in security, cleaning, or catering",India,"We address modern slavery risks through risk‑based due diligence across operations and suppliers, clear human rights standards in contracts, annual reviews of higher‑risk suppliers, AI‑enabled monitoring, training, audits, and speak‑up channels with investigation and remediation.",High‑risk geographies: Risk of labor rights violations among agency or subcontracted workers employed by suppliers,Within your supply chains,Tier 1 suppliers,Other vulnerable groups,"contracted workers in security, cleaning, or catering",India,"We address modern slavery risks through risk‑based due diligence across operations and suppliers, clear human rights standards in contracts, annual reviews of higher‑risk suppliers, AI‑enabled monitoring, training, audits, and speak‑up channels with investigation and remediation.","Abuse of vulnerability
