Other vulnerable groups","Ex-offenders, homeless persons.",United Kingdom,Organisation’s response: we now have bespoke training to our frontline staff on identifying and spotting signs of modern slavery and how to report suspected incidents or anyone in immediate danger. The Combined Authority's Whistleblowing Protocol has been updated to now include references to Safeguarding and Modern Slavery. We have also maintained and updated our Modern Slavery Policy as mandatory reading for all members of staff.,"Our Housing First and Homelessness public sector services. In particular, looking at cuckooing in the Liverpool City Region.",Within your own operations,,"Women
