Through trade unions or other worker representative groups",No,Lucid provides an Employee Assistance Program to all employees which offers support for any personal or work related issues. Lucid also has a anonymous whistle blower website and phone number.,Yes,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Yes,,,"Lucid’s products are considered software as a service (SaaS). The risk of modern slavery in our industry is low. For example, in order to provide our services, we require skilled labor. We do not sell physical products through a supply chain. In addition, Lucid expects all of its vendors to comply with all applicable laws including, but not limited to, employment laws and anti-corruption laws. Lucid will revisit this Modern Slavery Statement each year and assess any modern slavery risks.",2026-02-13T22:05:57,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/ENjsRAew/2026/2026 Lucid Software UK Modern Slavery Act Statement (1).pdf
