Turkey","Prior to onboarding any Tier 1 supplier, risk assessments & audits must be in place along with CAP reports.  Transparancy of the value chain and supplier engagment beyond common risk is on key areas : Freedom of Association / Living wages/Benefits to ensure a valued workforce.  Working in partnership with suppliers and identifying root causes is key to engagment and progress.  Suppliers should be long term partners and shared values embedded in the relationship.","Retail employees  often face heightened risks of exploitation due to poverty, migration, discrimination, cultural norms and limited access to education.
