Children",,,"As a general rule, the Bank will only contract with suppliers who are part of the FSQS scheme or, if they can provide a reasonable reason why they do not need to be a part of the scheme, that we check they have all the necessary due diligence in place to ensure that they are compliant with modern slavery legislation. In addition, we request to see copies of all modern slavery statements and reserve the right to attend premises.",,Yes,,,We have improved our training provided to front line and back office colleagues. We continue to monitor our suppliers for any modern slavery risks.,2026-10-08T15:25:08,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/EskSQMKf/2026/2025 Modern Slavery Statement.pdf
