Tier 3 suppliers and below",Other vulnerable groups,any vulnerable groups can be affected,United Kingdom,"Investec's risk and governance framework supports the identification and management of human rights and modern slavery risks across our operations, supply chains and investment activities. During 2025/26, we continued supplier due diligence and reassessment processes, strengthened monitoring through operational checks, delivered targeted training, and established a Modern Slavery Working Group to support ongoing oversight and continuous improvement.",,Yes,,,"Progress is measured through training feedback and continuous improvement. During 2025/26, feedback informed enhancements to training, guidance and remediation planning. Future objectives include strengthening transparency, accountability and risk monitoring, while continuing to engage external experts and embed best practice across our operations, supply chains and value chain.",2026-07-14T12:31:34,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/qAVC3mcp/2026/Investec Modern Slavery Act Statement 2026.pdf
