Mexico","With the guidance of Slave Free Alliance, we collaborated to design and implement a bespoke audit process, enhancing tender due diligence for supply chain partners operating in high-risk commodities and services.  Designed initially for our Uniform tender and involved a deeper review of our potential supplier partners supply chains for manufacture of the garments, we enhanced the obligations in our ITT docs, strengthened our MSA clauses and process for ongoing contract & supplier management.",,Yes,,,This year we have brokered a partnership with Slave Free Alliance and started a gap analysis programme.  This will report on areas we are managing well as an organisation and identify areas we have opportunity to improve on.  This will generate a plan for us to work towards and monitoring success against that plan will be part of the process.,2026-10-23T10:05:38,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/EEMzaqq6/2026/Stagecoach Modern Slavery Statement - Sep 26.pdf
