Refugees",,,"We include several questions related to forced labor in our annual surveys to our suppliers. Additionally, in our site visits to our suppliers and through interviews with suppliers' management and employees, we confirm that they understand, embrace and abide by our Policy for Sustainable Supply Chain Management which prohibits forced labor. If we identify any issues requiring rectification or improvement, we request the relevant supplier to implement corrective measures.",Child labor,Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
