Refugees",,,"We include several questions related to suitable remuneration in our annual surveys to our suppliers. Additionally, in our site visits to our suppliers and through interviews with suppliers' management and employees, we confirm that they understand, embrace and abide by our Policy for Sustainable Supply Chain Management which requires suitable remuneration. If we identify any issues requiring rectification or improvement, we request the relevant supplier to implement corrective measures.",,Yes,,,"We aim to demonstrate progress in our statement by disclosing the number of survey responses received from suppliers and the number of suppliers we are working with to share concerns, solve issues, etc. We also disclose figures related to employee training. Furthermore, we include a 'Looking ahead' section where we describe upcoming plans to ensure accountability in the year ahead.",2026-09-25T04:54:50,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/AErKdlst/2026/FY2025 Modern Slavery Statement(Mitsubishi Corporation).pdf
