LS11 5AE",Private,01163485,09/09/2026,Yes,POLYPIPE LIMITED,https://www.genuitgroup.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Modern-Slavery-Statement-2026.pdf,,https://modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/statement-summary/nsCV984i/2026,01/01/2025,31/12/2025,Joseph Vorih (Chief Executive Officer),22/05/2026,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,No,"We measure progress through compliance rates, supplier audits and other metrics internally and are working to create consistent Group KPIs, but do not yet report these within our statement.","Construction, civil engineering and building products",,,,Over £500 million,More than 5 years,"Freedom of workers to terminate employment
