Italy","Modern Slavery Group to review incidents, assess risk and drive improvement. Colleague training and briefing to raise awareness. Internal incident management and remediation process. Support the UK Seasonal Worker Scheme Taskforce to develop tangible actions to help safeguard and ensure access to workers’ rights in UK horticulture. Participated in ETI Grievance Mechanisms in Agriculture project to improve access to grievance mechanisms for vulnerable agricultural workers in Italy and Spain.",Forced and bonded labour in the Chinese and Indian manufacturing sectors,Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
Tier 2 suppliers","Women
